<cem:title lang="" subtitle="">Lesson Test</cem:title>
<cem:description lang="">This virtual learning object "Lesson Test" that makes part of the lesson No: 15, The Next Step which belongs to English teaching Upper-intermediate (B2.3), is intended to work on: describe the reasons or results of events or actions in spoken or written texts, in work and social contexts; express duty, advice, willingness, or intention to do something in spoken or written texts and in work and social contexts; identify ways of improving aspects of communication in English based on the learning outcomes for level Intermediate B. The purpose of this object is to: discuss reasons and results of an event or action express duty and advice in present situations express willingness or intention to do something request or report about the purpose of events or actions express willingness or intention to do something in a written way express for claiming, mentioning, requesting, or pointing out an idea, thing, issue talk or report about things, actions, events, or people write about the present results of something in the past write about the purpose of events or actions express emotions and feelings. It evaluates grammar, vocabulary, and pronunciation.</cem:description>
