<cem:description>
<cem:recommendedUse lang="en">This learning object can be used as an assessment to evaluate the student in all grammar, vocabulary, and usage aspects of the English language taught in the lesson.</cem:recommendedUse>
<cem:triggerQuestion lang="en">How do my results reflect my learning process?</cem:triggerQuestion>
<cem:pedagogicalAspect lang="en">This learning object "Lesson Test" that belongs to the lesson No. 15, The Next Step which belongs to the Upper-intermediate (B2.3) of the teaching of English as a foreign language, allows the learner to evaluate the contents and topics developed throughout the eleven learning objects. The information in this LO is presented in an online content learning pedagogical approach. This means that students are to develop their language skills by using a digital content as well as the guidance of a SENA instructor.</cem:pedagogicalAspect>
<cem:learningGoal lang="en">The purpose of this learning object is to assess the learning process and what the student has acquired during the study of the lesson.</cem:learningGoal>
</cem:description>
